  "description": "An always-learning neural concurrency tuner for EvalApp. A holographic policy model (HoloFormer, d48/L2/K2/shifts8) plugs into your app's resource gates and keeps retuning online as conditions shift — it matches the built-in heuristic on clean pipelines and beats it ~25-30% on coupled, noisy workloads (multi-gate DB+disk+CPU scenarios). Ships warm-started, minimal overhead, never frozen. Opt in with .WithNeuralTuning().",
